/*
  FSMTimelineChart.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0231 · FSMTimelineChart (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `FSMTimelineChart` resolves (table "FSMTimelineChart") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/system/components/FSMTimelineChart.tsx). The remainder back the native
  state envelope (axis titles, freshness chip, connectivity banner, loading / empty
  / error chrome) plus the accessibility summaries — keyed here so no English literal
  lives in native code.
*/

